{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4165a44e-63f9-8b17-bebb-f11dc939f32b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-05T11:36:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis N. Medeiros",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Good morning. Yes, I have a question about voting. My cousin is here with me, she helps me with English. Is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:34:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, that's fine. Go ahead, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to change my party. I am registered, but I want a different party. How I do this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:34:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. You'd fill out a new voter registration form with the new party marked on it. You can do that with a paper form or through the state's online system. Do you want me to mail you a form?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Sorry. Can you say again, slower? The online, the paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:34:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Option one, a paper form. I can mail it to you, or you can pick one up here at City Hall. Option two, you do the same thing online on the state website. Either way you just choose the new party."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. Paper is better for me. Please send."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. What's the mailing address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "449 Gidley Street. Newport."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "449 Gidley Street, got it. And your name, please?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Luis Medeiros. M-E-D-E-I-R-O-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Medeiros. I'll get that in the mail today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:17-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And the deadline? Is a day I must finish by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there's a cutoff before each election, and a separate rule for changing party before a primary. Since you're asking now, I'd send the form back as soon as you get it. Is there a particular election you're thinking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The next one. In the fall, the primary. [line breaks up] Sorry, my cousin says, the September."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, then you have some time, but don't wait. When the form comes, the dates will be on the instructions, and you can call me back if anything is unclear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you very much. I like, you are very polite on the phone. Is nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:35:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's kind of you to say. Have a good afternoon, Mr. Medeiros."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-05T11:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
